---
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import { legalPages } from "../content/legal";
import { site } from "../config/site";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { enquiryAction, pageCrumbs } from "../lib/links";

const crumbs = pageCrumbs([{ label: legalPages.terms.label, href: legalPages.terms.href }]);
const sendsEnquiry = enquiryAction(site.enquiryEndpoint) !== null;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Website terms"
  description="Example website terms for the Webco Essential demonstration of a fictional HGV training provider. Not a training contract and not legal advice."
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <PageHero
    crumbs={crumbs}
    eyebrow="Example"
    title="Website terms"
    lede="Example terms for using this demonstration website. They are not a training contract, not a set of booking conditions, and not legal advice for a real business."
  />

  <Section id="about-terms" title="What these terms cover" narrow={true}>
    <p>
      Webco Essential is a fictional provider on a demonstration built by Webco Media. The courses, reviews, town and
      contact details are examples. {site.phoneDisplay}, {site.email} and {site.location.town} are placeholders.
    </p>
    <p>
      These terms describe the sample website. They do not create a contract for driver training, and they do not name
      a company number, a VAT number or a registered office. A real provider replaces this page with terms written for
      their own business.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section id="training" title="Training information" band={true} narrow={true}>
    <p>
      The pages explain Category C, Category C+E and Driver CPC in general terms. They are not an official statement of
      licence rules, and they do not confirm that you are eligible. Duration and price are not published. Nothing on
      the site books a test or reserves a course date.
    </p>
    <p>
      {
        sendsEnquiry
          ? "Sending the enquiry form only passes on the message. It does not confirm a place."
          : "The enquiry form on this demonstration does not send a message and does not reserve a place."
      }
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section id="using" title="Using the website" narrow={true}>
    <p>
      You may read the pages and use the links. Please do not attempt to misuse the form, interfere with the site, or
      present the sample reviews and placeholder contact details as a real business.
    </p>
    <p>
      The design and sample text are part of the Webco Essential demonstration. Course names such as Category C are
      ordinary descriptions of licence categories, not a claim of accreditation. This site does not display an
      accreditation, a pass rate or a review score.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section id="links" title="Links and responsibility" band={true} narrow={true}>
    <p>
      A link to phone, email or WhatsApp takes you out of this website. What happens next is outside this
      demonstration. Sample pages can be incomplete on purpose, including the map, which is a placeholder until a real
      provider adds one.
    </p>
    <p>
      This demonstration is a showcase. It is not a promise that a particular course, date, vehicle or result is
      available. A live provider is responsible for their own information, their own enquiries, and their own terms.
    </p>
    <p>
      Also see the <a href={legalPages.privacy.href}>privacy policy</a> and the
      <a href={legalPages.cookies.href}>cookie policy</a>.
    </p>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
